							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">IM SO PISSED I GOTTA TELL YALL ABOUT THIS!<br />&nbsp;<br />my lady and i attend south seattle. today she went to eng 101 like she usually does after printing her rough draft for group/peer editing. we see each other in between classes so i was walkin to the &#039;university center&#039; [new building] and i see her at the top of the stairs outside her classroom.<br /><br />her: hi babe<br />me: hey..why you out here...what happened..[i notice her crying]<br />her: some guy annoyed me...we were in our groups and you know how i wrote about me and the car...[she personified the car to tell how her personality is]<br />me: yeah and ...<br />her: this guy said i should write about tupac in it for some reason...and i told him i dont listen to tupac much..AND HE SAID I SHOULD GET MY HEAD BANGED ON THE TABLE... [mothaFUCKAA!! MAN I WAS READY TO KILL SOMEBODY!!]<br />me: what oh hell no! point him out to me...i just want to confront him<br />her: babe please dont do anything..<br /><br />so the class ends and this happens within 5 minutes...people start coming out and finally the punk ass comes out with this buddy...and i ask which one of you said that to my girl. and his punk ass cant even look at me...he keeps his eye contact to my lady and starts sayin i didnt mean it i didnt know you were gun take it like that..this whole time im there FURIOUS!! sayin well you dont know her DONT TALK TO MY LADY LIKE THAT! ...gettin loud!<br /><br />and one thing that pisses me off more..a bystander [student maybe in early 30s who happens to be white also] is saying in the background: &#039;okaay ..calm down...he said he&#039;s sorry [FUCK THAT! LIKE A SORRY IS GUN MAKE ME CALM DOWN!! she didnt even know what we were talkin about!!!]<br /><br />and finally guy walks away and has the nerve to say: why you trippin?&#039;<br />im still mad so i say: you wann do somethin about it?&#039;<br />you can tell he was scared &#039;cause he said: &#039;did i say i wanted to?&quot; as he got down the stairs<br /><br />we go into the classroom to get her stuff<br /><br />person in the background outside the classroom comes in and sits down: you need to calm down he already apologized.<br /><br />me: ITS NONE OF YOUR BUSINESS! [in my head im thinkin THIS AINT IRAQ BITCH STAY OUT!...IM NOT RACISTS and FAR FROM IGNORANT BUT I CANT BLAME MYSELF FOR&nbsp; ASSUMING SHE DEFENDED THE OTHER STUDENT &#039;CAUSE THEY ARE WHITE]<br /><br />she also had the nerve to say i was tryin to start a fight in her school<br />i told em i didnt touch anybody and she said i was gettin loud [WHAT! IM FROM THE THIRD WORLD I GOTTA GET LOUD TO BE HEARD]<br /><br />my lady was so worried i&#039;d follow the punk [who i recognize from franklin] and beat his ass! made me promise not to do anythin before she went to class. on my way to the library one asian friend of the punk was tryin to tell me he didnt mean it and the teacher wants to get involved...HAH I DONT CARE!<br /><br />***************writing this has calmed me down a bit BUT i just had to make sure it was clear they dont know my lady and they are not gun talk to her like that...she can hold her own i know that BUT I WILL NOT LET ANYONE DISRESPECT MY LADY!!! <br />AND I HOPE EVERYONE IN THIS FORUM HOLDS UP EVERY WOMAN IN THEIR LIFE...YA MOTHER..SISTAH..AUNT...WIFE..GF..FRIENDS<br /><br />thank you!<br />-hyp<br /><br /><br /><br /></div>
